          "review": [{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"khushbu nayak"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X is a great option for those seeking a fast and efficient electric scooter. While it's generally reliable, there have been some issues with noise and software glitches.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.7,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"tamsil ahmed"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been impressed with the Ather 450X's speed and handling. The new mirrors are an improvement, but there's room for better software integration.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"vibha dogra"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X is a solid choice for city rides, offering good performance and range. However, the seat height can be an issue for some riders.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"sohit"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've faced some reliability issues with the Ather 450X, particularly with software errors. However, the staff is knowledgeable and helpful.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"shahil"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X offers a premium riding experience with its fast modes and good range. However, the delivery experience was smoother than the ongoing service support.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"kavya"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I love the Ather 450X for its nimble handling and strong brakes. It's comfortable to ride, but the fit and finish could be better.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"taniya"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X is a great choice for those looking for a premium electric scooter. However, the lack of a USB port or mobile holder is a drawback.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"shavan"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've had mixed experiences with the Ather 450X. While it's fast and efficient, there have been some issues with noise levels at lower speeds and software glitches.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"nalini chaudhary"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X is a sporty and reliable scooter. I've achieved a range of up to 100 km on a single charge using smart eco mode. However, the service experience could be improved.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.2,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"smita patel"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"I've been using the Ather 450X for a few months now, and it's been a reliable choice. The warp mode is incredibly fast, but I wish there were more storage options.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.8,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"rishabh jain"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X is a fantastic scooter for daily use. It offers a great range, and the charging time is reasonable. The design is sleek and modern, making it a favorite among young riders.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4.5,"bestRating":"5"}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"khushbu nayak"},"datePublished":"2025-03-08","reviewBody":"The Ather 450X is a great option for those seeking a fast and efficient electric scooter. While it's generally reliable, there have been some is